ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/15089df3cd31975425a37c4f4e97b10d.mp4?t=1784912860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something twisted is hunting you through the house, following the echo of your footsteps and the memories unearthed by the lights. However, you need the light to progress, making every flick of the switch a gamble that might summon the very terror trying to tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/538f40c280ea6750f1375c5a40d91909.avif?t=1784912860\" width=399 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/ee5abdccba820aa8f49fc3dcfbf8ffd7.poster.avif?t=1784912860\" width=1138 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/ee5abdccba820aa8f49fc3dcfbf8ffd7.webm?t=1784912860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/ee5abdccba820aa8f49fc3dcfbf8ffd7.mp4?t=1784912860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality Shifting:</strong> Toggling a light switch instantly alters a room from a safe reality to a horrifying echo where critical items and mind-bending puzzles manifest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fractured Storyline:</strong> Search through the remnants of your family's desperate escape and unearth the sickening history of those who resided here long before you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environments:</strong> Navigate highly detailed, oppressive rooms where atmospheric lighting and deep shadows conceal threats around every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/d4d5d6989963723cef9e6f79ea9e7db2.poster.avif?t=1784912860\" width=1138 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/d4d5d6989963723cef9e6f79ea9e7db2.webm?t=1784912860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/extras/d4d5d6989963723cef9e6f79ea9e7db2.mp4?t=1784912860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Shift realities with the flick of a light switch and plunge into the grotesque to uncover your family's twisted past. A psychological horror game where you must balance the light you need to progress with the terrifying nightmares it summons.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/903afe0bf28cc39a589a0de43a54acfa3b69632e/header.jpg?t=1784912860", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/a8e0083c48d07762b79cc3ad4263921e3943ea0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784912860", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450660/a8e0083c48d07762b79cc3ad4263921e3943ea0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784912860", "website": "https://www.inqdropstudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia 970 or equ